 "Zombie", "RPG", "Sword"], "long_description": "One More Delve is a physics-based VR dungeon crawler. Fight, loot, and survive in up to 3 player co-op as you delve into randomized dungeons.\n# Physics-Based Combat\nEngage in realistic melee combat where every slash, parry, and block matters. Feel the true weight of your weapons as you dismember your enemies.\n{2075948720015369}\n# Upgrade Your Character\nLoot new armor and weapons to configure your own playstyle. Choose from one- and two-handed swords, axes, bows, shields and spells to help you fight and explore your way towards the final boss of the dungeon.\n{2449503938858684}{1952446932077468}\n# Social Hub Server\nBetween dungeon runs, relax in the social hub, interact with other players and use the materials you've gathered to craft new weapons and armor.\n{2204437950295197}\nJoin a party or beat the dungeon as a solo adventurer.\n{967269222704290}\n\n **Talk to the developer and join the community:** Discord.gg/GC4CqRebvF", "short_description": "One More Delve is a physics-based VR dungeon crawler. Fight, loot, and survive in up to 3 player co-op as you delve into randomized dungeons.\n\n- Wield one- and two-handed weapons, bows, shields and spells\n- Master physics-based combat to slash, bash and dismember your enemies\n- Team up in 3-player co-op to conquer the dungeons together\n- Loot new armor and weapons to configure your own playstyle\n- Return to the social hub to craft gear and plan your next dungeon run"}]}, "developer_name": "ATVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/W1zurd/OneMoreDelvePrivacyPolicy/blob/main/OneMoreDelvePrivacyPolicy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ATVR", "support_website_url": "https://discord.com/invite/GC4CqRebvF", "website_url": "https://atvrgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [